    {
      "id": "is-missing-member-potentially-loading",
      "name": "IsMissingMemberPotentiallyLoading",
      "category": "KismetCompilerMisc",
      "signature": "IsMissingMemberPotentiallyLoading(Self Blueprint, Member Owner)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Self Blueprint",
          "type": "UBlueprint*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Member Owner",
          "type": "UStruct*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Intended to avoid errors that come from checking for external member\n(function, variable, etc.) dependencies. This can happen when a Blueprint\nwas saved without having new members compiled in (saving w/out compiling),\nand a Blueprint that uses those members is compiled-on-load before the\nuncompiled one. Any valid errors should surface later, when the dependant\nBlueprint's bytecode is recompiled."
    },
